'''Co-op Mode''' (相棒, ''Aibō'', '''Partner''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 9.0 Update|Version 9.0]].

==Effect==
Unit Attack UP (Sm): Cats' attack power increases by 10%.

